Z||000024||BENGAL4||08-08-2001||09:57 PM||||OK folks, here are the directions to the cruise-in.<P>From the Cincinnati area.<P>Take I-275 to the Rt 127 (Hamilton Ave) exit, it is the one past Forest Fair Mall if you are heading west. If you are heading east, it is the one after Colerain Ave.<P>Go north until you get to Nilles Rd. It should be the 7th traffic light. UDF is on the left and Krogers is on the right. <P>Turn right on Nilles and Jolly's Drive In is on the left. You cant miss it.<P>If you are coming from KY, take I-75 north thru the city and head west on I-275. Follow the above directions.<P>Those of you who want to find Jolly's on Mapquest, the address is.<P>Jolly's Drive In<BR>650 Nilles Rd<BR>Fairfield, Oh 45014<P>Count, my 3800 Series II S/C beast will be there. Come on up, it would be great to meet you.<P>My7fieros, I am coming to Nashville on the weekend of September 15. I am going to hook up with Songman, come on up yourself.<P>Bill  ||||reg||10
